# Framework Beaver — Guia para geração de testes

Este projeto usa o framework BEAVER (custom).
NAO e Laravel. NAO e Symfony.

## REGRAS ABSOLUTAS — NUNCA usar

- use Illuminate\...  (Laravel)
- use Symfony\...     (Symfony)
- Request::fake()
- $response->getStatusCode()
- $response->headers->get()
- Route::get()
- $request->validate()

## Namespaces reais

- App\Controllers\
- App\Services\
- Beaver\Http\
- Beaver\Plugin\
- Beaver\Plugins\FrankeiTrial\
- Tests\

## Beaver\Http\Request

Metodos publicos:
- static capture(): self
- input(string $key, mixed $default = null): mixed
- all(): array
- header(string $name, ?string $default = null): ?string
- isMethod(string $method): bool
- ip(): ?string
- isJson(): bool

NAO existe: validate(), file(), method().

## Beaver\Http\Response

Propriedades publicas:
- $content (string)
- $status (int)
- $headers (array)

Metodos estaticos:
- html(string $content, int $status = 200): self
- json(mixed $data, int $status = 200): self
- text(string $content, int $status = 200): self
- css(string $content, int $status = 200): self
- js(string $content, int $status = 200): self
- redirect(string $url, int $status = 302): self

Metodos de instancia:
- withHeader(string $name, string $value): self
- send(): void

NAO existe: getStatusCode(), getContent(), getHeaders().

## Controllers

- Namespace: App\Controllers\
- Metodos devolvem VOID (nao Response)
- Usam $_GET e $_POST diretamente
- Redirecionam com $this->go('/path')
- Renderizam com $this->renderView('pasta/vista', $dados)
- Sao classes HTTP — nao testaveis em teste unitario sem simular $_GET/$_POST

## Routing

- Classe: Beaver\Http\Router
- Registo em routes/web.php:
    $router->get('/path', function ($req) { ... });
    $router->post('/path', [$ctrl, 'metodo']);
    $router->get('/admin', [$ctrl, 'index'], [RequireAuth::class]);

- Middlewares: RequireAuth, RequireGuest

## Plugins

Cada plugin vive em plugins/<slug>/ com:
- plugin.json     (metadados)
- composer.json   (autoload PSR-4)
- routes/web.php  (rotas do plugin)
- src/            (namespace Beaver\Plugins\<Nome>\)
- resources/views/, resources/ui/js/, resources/ui/css/

## Testes

Framework: Pest + PHPUnit.

tests/TestCase.php:
    namespace Tests;
    use PHPUnit\Framework\TestCase as BaseTestCase;
    abstract class TestCase extends BaseTestCase {}

Estilo Pest:
    <?php
    use Tests\TestCase;
    uses(TestCase::class);

    it('descricao', function () {
        expect($valor)->toBe(...);
    });

Ficheiros: tests/Unit/*Test.php

## Servicos comuns

- App\Services\UserService
    - UserService::autenticado(): bool

- App\Services\SiteDB
    - SiteDB::select($sql, $params): array
    - SiteDB::exec($sql, $params): int

## EXEMPLO DE TESTE CORRETO (servico puro)

    <?php
    use Tests\TestCase;
    use App\Services\Calc;

    uses(TestCase::class);

    it('soma dois inteiros', function () {
        $calc = new Calc();
        expect($calc->soma(2, 3))->toBe(5);
    });

